# ChromaDB persistent storage
chroma_data/
# His semantic memory lives inside a source directory that a deploy overwrites,
# so this is an allowlist, not a denylist: everything here is ignored and the
# one file that belongs in the repo is named back in. Listing the formats
# instead (*.bin, *.sqlite3, */) held only until Chroma wrote a file of a shape
# nobody had listed, and that file would then ride a deploy onto the server.
#
# The first line must NOT be written "vector_store/" — git cannot re-include a
# file whose parent directory is excluded, and the negation below would be dead.
infrastructure/vector_store/*
# The embedding-model stamp is meant to be tracked: a mismatch between it and
# the configured model is supposed to be loud, and it cannot be if it is local.
!infrastructure/vector_store/.embedding_model

